| `results/sample-pca.png` | `figure` | PC1 versus PC2 scatter plot, coloured by condition and labelled by sample ID |
| `results/sample-pca-coordinates.csv` | `table` | Per-sample PC coordinates, condition labels, and explained-variance fractions |

